{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "g-in",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "📥 数据接收层",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 1390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "recv-phone",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "phone-usage-receiver :8765\n• 入口: Funnel 443（唯一公网）\n• X-Upload-Token / Bearer 鉴权\n• archive/YYYY-MM-DD（30 天压缩/365 天删除,\n  维护 timer 03:30 Persistent 补跑）",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "recv-sync",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "syncthing@conrad.service\n• receive-only: activitywatch-sync / \n  behavior-context-sync / pi-client-migration\n• send-only: focus-garden-archive（快照）\n• 禁止把活跃 SQLite 改双向同步",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "legacy-usagehub",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "text": "旧目标 usage-hub（⚠️ 未实现）\n• 旧规划：SQLite / 半小时与每日汇总中心\n• 当前实际：JSONL 归档 + facts / 报告链\n• 维护时不要按旧目录或旧 schema 操作",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "g-half",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "⏰ 半小时处理链（08/38 分）",
      "x": 560,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 2120,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hh-timer",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "activitywatch-advisor.timer\n• 每小时在 :08/:38 → run_half_hour.py\n• 40 分钟事实窗口（30+前后 5min）",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "hh-facts",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "facts 分层（审计保留，决策读摘要）\n• computer/phone/tablet → combined\n• tagged（config/tag_rules.json）\n• semantic_timelines → mixing_metrics\n• 全设备静默 → 跳过 AI 仍归档",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "hh-report",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "data/ai_reports/YYYY-MM-DD/HH-MM.{json,md}\n• 网页仅暴露最新 3 条（去 Markdown 阅读版）\n• PushPlus 半小时推送已停用\n  （drop-in UnsetEnvironment 清 token）",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "hh-shadow",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "半小时提醒候选\n• data/intervention_candidates/\n• would_intervene=true → 半小时 ntfy 检查\n• ⚠️ 文档要求 shadow_mode=true；当前启用状态待确认",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 1190,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-flash",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "DeepSeek V4 flash\n• 语义时间线 / 报告生成\n• 近期动态解析（thinking=disabled）\n• 15:00 进度裁决 / 召回粗筛\n• 失败降级本地规则/低置信",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-ctx",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "📋 Obsidian/任务上下文",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 1290,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx-snapshot",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "context_snapshot.json → data/context_cache/\n• Profile / Tasks / 番茄钟 / 睡眠边界\n• content age 大 ≠ 故障: 看 sync_heartbeat\n  （source_changed=false 时正常）",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx-taskq",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "data/task_sync/state.json（mutation queue）\n• Pi 只存队列，不写 Vault（插件是唯一写入者）\n• 循环任务只读投影（every week on …）\n• ack 语义校验后清除；409 冲突保留草稿",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx-recent",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "data/recent_context/state.json\n• 近期动态（原文权威，recorded_at 基准）\n• parse_audit.jsonl 审计；≤6 条注入建议\n• selector_candidate_limit=30（旧文档 20，⚠️ 待确认旧记录）",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-rm",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "⏱️ 提醒与统计 timers",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 2410,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "rm-daily",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "每日生活复盘 09:00/10:00/11:00\n• 早晨边界未现 → 后延重试\n• 11:00 仍无 → possible_fault 低置信日报\n• data/statistics/daily_life/ + ntfy 回执",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "rm-weekly",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "周报 周一 09:05 → PushPlus\n• PushPlus 唯一保留的通知（半小时已停）",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "rm-bedtime",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "深夜提醒 00:30–04:30（每分钟检查）\n• 两层升级 + 25min 冷却；120s 数据新鲜度\n• 过期记 activity_data_stale 不升级",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "rm-1500",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "15:00 任务进度检查\n• 任务+番茄各半综合进度 <0.5 → ntfy high\n• V4 flash 裁决，失败退确定性规则\n• 不写回 Windows/Obsidian",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "rm-sysadmin",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "系统维护守护 每 3 分钟\n• 最近 60min 维护占比（30min≥75% / 60min≥65%）\n• ChatGPT/Codex ≤300s 邻近继承；数学词优先排除\n• ⚠️ 发送 env 文件与 30/60min 表述待确认",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "ntfy-out",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "通知出口\n• ntfy.sh: 日报/深夜/15:00/维护/半小时候选\n• env：/home/conrad/.config/activitywatch-advisor/ntfy.env\n  与 ntfy-halfhour.env（600；值不写 Canvas）\n• PushPlus 仅周报（见 rm-weekly）",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 1870,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-na",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "🎯 Next Action 决策（:8767 → :8450）",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 1440,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "na-web",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "activitywatch-advisor-web.service\n• 127.0.0.1:8767，tailnet-only :8450\n• 当前交接口径为免密码；⚠️ 旧 401 记录待清理\n• 页面 /next、任务清单、近期动态\n• 介入 API / issue-feedback / heartbeat",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "na-decision",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "决策链 build_decision_state()\n• 硬规则: 午休 12:00–13:00；🍅=40min 中等可靠\n• 输入: 报告/指标/上下文/反馈/近期动态\n• V4 Pro thinking → 只推荐 1 个行动\n• decision_trace 只存审计摘要",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "na-loop",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "闭环与反馈\n• active.json 未闭环 → 409 强制先反馈\n• 响应 responses/ outcomes/ 回流下一次\n• 行动澄清最多 2 轮（revision 校验）\n• 任务时间窗只影响建议锁定，不改 Obsidian",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-garden",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "🌱 专注花园（:8838 → :8460）",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 2050,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gd-service",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "focus-garden.service\n• app.py + focus_garden/{server,database,pi_sync}.py\n• 监听 127.0.0.1:8838（禁 Funnel/0.0.0.0）\n• NextActionProxy: loopback→8767 白名单 +\n  X-Focus-Garden-Bridge: 1\n• 系统状态面板 /api/system-status（只读聚合）",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 400,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "gd-sqlite",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "权威 SQLite（唯一写入端）\n• /home/conrad/services/focus-garden/data/\n  focus-garden.sqlite3（WAL）\n• rewards / garden_plants / focus_sessions /\n  focus_pauses / counters\n• reconciler 每 2s 检查到期/暂停恢复\n• ⚠️ 无 schema version/迁移工具",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 450,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "gd-backup",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "focus-garden-backup.timer（每分钟）\n• SQLite backup API 原子一致性快照\n• → Syncthing send-only → Windows 镜像\n  D:\\MyFocusGardenArchive（receive-only）\n• 恢复只复制快照，禁止双向启用",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "gd-rewards",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "奖励数据源（只读聚合 advisor JSON）\n• 介入 accepted+success / AI 闭环（同一\n  suggestion_id）/ 早睡估计（日报 period）\n• 40min 专注账本 → 任务 🍅 目标进 queue\n• 分级兑换: 3 接受→1 初级；3 初级→1 高级",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-fb",
      "type": "group",
